    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Using dreaming Immortal Gu as the core, Fang Yuan’s body shines in a layer of profound light that can defend against some dream path abilities and clear disruption of his thoughts during a dream path tribulation. After the pure dream clone’s ascension, the main body holds rank seven Dreaming and rank eight Dream Token while Dream Armor is with the clone; alone, Dream Token is hard to use and is rated less useful than rank seven dreaming Immortal Gu in Fang Yuan’s case. Fang Yuan later gives dreaming Immortal Gu to the pure dream clone, who uses three Immortal Gu to pass remaining tribulations.",
